{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b7f944d081c91ffbcd53e66b36bb229b.poster.avif?t=1762394017\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b7f944d081c91ffbcd53e66b36bb229b.webm?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b7f944d081c91ffbcd53e66b36bb229b.mp4?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rain98: A lo-fi psycho-thriller romance adventure set in '90s Tokyo.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a chill but dark apartment room, you're joined by Reina Amehara (VA: Rio Tsuchiya), a girl with a mysterious and somewhat dangerous charm to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you decide you have to perform a strange ritual... to save the world from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/c0ebd6675a1297817e13bab0142b4207.poster.avif?t=1762394017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/c0ebd6675a1297817e13bab0142b4207.webm?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/c0ebd6675a1297817e13bab0142b4207.mp4?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's a charming girl by your side... but she can be a pain.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned money to keep Reina fed and happy. Especially happy. Under no circumstances is she to be made upset. That would lead to terrible, terrible things happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your days with her will be sweet, bitter, somewhat scary, and always strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/8e595498bc5d846ad2b293651a7e3c97.poster.avif?t=1762394017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/8e595498bc5d846ad2b293651a7e3c97.webm?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/8e595498bc5d846ad2b293651a7e3c97.mp4?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tokyo at the Turn of the Millennium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public phones ringing, game arcades beeping, and the neon signs of Shibuya shining through the lukewarm rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse this old city with Reina while you work on your secret ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/af625f39406ea6e4c71f0cc26528dd67.poster.avif?t=1762394017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/af625f39406ea6e4c71f0cc26528dd67.webm?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/af625f39406ea6e4c71f0cc26528dd67.mp4?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Private Solace in a Dying Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the nostalgic feeling of late '90s Tokyo all alone with Reina through a variety of minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b32df3f2e80ca1a05bcb4ed088459fb7.poster.avif?t=1762394017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b32df3f2e80ca1a05bcb4ed088459fb7.webm?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/b32df3f2e80ca1a05bcb4ed088459fb7.mp4?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Psycho-Thriller Horror Between Reality and Delusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things start feeling off, your memories become foggy, and Reina still holds onto a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is what you see real? Is it your mind playing tricks on you? Tokyo's rain washes the truth away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/f3e3a186625eb121d48df478182cebfa.poster.avif?t=1762394017\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/f3e3a186625eb121d48df478182cebfa.webm?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498720/extras/f3e3a186625eb121d48df478182cebfa.mp4?t=1762394017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kick Back with Rain98's Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole range of chill lo-fi tunes will fill your room with nostalgy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with the sound effects of the surrounding environment, they'll transport you straight into the '90s.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.co